    affiliation: Polytechnique Montréal
repository-code: "https://github.com/Petitepoupoune/GPS-Spoofing-Dataset"
abstract: >
  A labelled synthetic dataset of commercial aviation flight trajectories
  enriched with GPS spoofing scenarios covering three attack types
  (position channel LL, timing channel ZL, Doppler velocity channel GA),
  three severity levels, and three flight phases, across five aircraft types.
  Expert-validated with inter-rater agreement κ = 0.81.
keywords:
  - GPS spoofing
  - GNSS cybersecurity
  - commercial aviation
  - synthetic dataset
  - avionics cybersecurity
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2025-06-01"
